          "text": "```java\n/**\n * Test unequal comparisons with second comparators.\n */\npublic void testSecond() {\n    aDateTime = new DateTime(2004, 6, 9, 12, 30, 15, 250, DateTimeZone.UTC);\n    bDateTime = aDateTime.plusSeconds(1);\n\n    assertEquals(\"SecondM1\", -1, cSecond.compare(aDateTime, bDateTime));\n    assertEquals(\"SecondP1\", 1, cSecond.compare(bDateTime, aDateTime));\n\n    // Millisecond differences within the same second are ignored.\n    bDateTime = aDateTime.plusMillis(500);\n    assertEquals(\"SecondEqual\", 0, cSecond.compare(aDateTime, bDateTime));\n}\n```"
